    "claims": [
      "Combines BC planning with etagis graphical production planning and optimization",
      "Visualizes production orders, operations, machines, times and employees on a planning board",
      "Changes on the planning board update BC data and vice versa",
      "Changes can be simulated before being activated in BC",
      "Finite capacity planning",
      "Rule-based simulation and optimization",
      "Detects bottlenecks dynamically",
      "Offers sales, utilization and resource planning views",
      "Respects dependencies in order networks including purchased items and contract manufacturing",
      "Supports alternative resources and machine assignments",
      "Frozen zone and fixed operations are respected",
      "Shows overdue deadlines in red and includes queue analysis",
      "Cross-company planning is available on request",
      "Requires BC Premium edition"
    ],
